                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—No official record of this conversation has been found. The principal subject of
                    conversation was the accuracy of Soviet statements relating to Finnish shipping
                    captured by the Soviet Union.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d710a-96-f1"/></p>
            </div>
